P_{\\mathrm{fin}}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\)</span> (finite powerset, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(\\mathsf L)=-1\">\\(d(\\mathsf L)=-1\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(\\mathsf R)=1\">\\(d(\\mathsf R)=1\\)</span> (head displacements, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在配置与运行子句中，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\)</span>；分量是固定元组的唯一投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 的结构子句以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 为候选对象，不预先假设该结构谓词；其余子句才固定上面给出的有效机器。一步关系的两个参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NConf}_{N}\">\\(\\operatorname{NConf}_{N}\\)</span> 中的配置。所有带编号属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span>，运行长度属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,s)\">\\(\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,s)\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 为候选图；其函数类型由右侧见证检验，不能预先调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(0)\">\\(s(0)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(m)\">\\(s(m)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\exists\\Delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nN=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land 0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\land\\Delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k)\n\\land q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\exists\\Delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nN=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land 0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\land\\Delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k)\n\\land q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in Q\\times(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\times\\mathbb Z^k:\n\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in Q\\times(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\times\\mathbb Z^k:\n\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}w(i),&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|w|,\\\\ \\mathrm{blank},&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le i,\\end{cases}\n\\quad T_{\\mathrm{blank}}(i)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{blank},\\quad\nC_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(q_0,\\langle T_w\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle T_{\\mathrm{blank}}:2\\le j\\le k\\rangle,\\langle 0:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}w(i),&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|w|,\\\\ \\mathrm{blank},&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le i,\\end{cases}\n\\quad T_{\\mathrm{blank}}(i)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{blank},\\quad\nC_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(q_0,\\langle T_w\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle T_{\\mathrm{blank}}:2\\le j\\le k\\rangle,\\langle 0:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\leadsto_N(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl((q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\land(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\bigr)\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\Gamma^k\\,\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\exists H\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k)\\;\n\\Bigl(((q,\\langle(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)):1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),H)\\in\\Delta\\land(q&#39;,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf D)\\in H\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T&#39;)=(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))[\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)\\mapsto \\pi_j(\\mathbf a)]\\land \\pi_j(\\mathbf h&#39;)=\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)+d(\\pi_j(\\mathbf D))))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\leadsto_N(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl((q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\land(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\bigr)\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\Gamma^k\\,\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\exists H\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k)\\;\n\\Bigl(((q,\\langle(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)):1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),H)\\in\\Delta\\land(q&#39;,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf D)\\in H\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T&#39;)=(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))[\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)\\mapsto \\pi_j(\\mathbf a)]\\land \\pi_j(\\mathbf h&#39;)=\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)+d(\\pi_j(\\mathbf D))))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\Bigl[s=\\rho\\land\\rho(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;m\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\leadsto_N\\rho(i+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\Bigl[s=\\rho\\land\\rho(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;m\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\leadsto_N\\rho(i+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_N(w)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho)\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))=q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\bigr),\\qquad\nL(N)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*: \\operatorname{Accept}_N(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_N(w)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho)\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))=q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\bigr),\\qquad\nL(N)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*: \\operatorname{Accept}_N(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NConf}_N\">\\(\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\">\\(C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\)</span> explicitly use the same finite-support multitape and input conventions as the deterministic model.</li>\n<li>Acceptance is existential over finite branches; rejection of a word is not inferred merely from one rejecting branch.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-local-transition","status":"resolved","id":"51696a3513b66fda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}$ (finite powerset, see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-local-transition","status":"resolved","id":"51696a3513b66fda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$d(\\mathsf L)=-1$ and $d(\\mathsf R)=1$ (head displacements, see [[73-df-dtm-local-transition]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{